                <pb facs="0427" n="355" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg355"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister for Foreign Affairs to Minister
                        Heimké.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs, Republic of Guatemala</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1909-07-06"><hi rendition="#italic">July 6,
                                1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: Referring to your attentive
                    official communication of May 31 last, I have the honor to advise your
                    excellency that Mr. Luis Estrada Monzón has recently taken charge of the
                    jefatura politica and comandancia de armas of the Department of Izabal in
                    substitution of Col. Alberto García.</p>
                <p>I avail, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">G. Aguirre.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
